{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩經詮釋 · 定之方中，作于楚宮。揆之以日，作于楚室。樹之榛栗。椅桐梓漆，爰伐琴瑟。升彼虛矣，以望楚矣。望楚與堂，景山與京。降觀于桑。卜云其吉，終然允臧。靈雨既零，命彼倌人。星言夙駕，說于桑田。匪直也人，秉心塞淵，騋牝三千！ · 屈万里 · 注释","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 定之方中 · 《詩經詮釋》关于“定之方中，作于楚宮。揆之以日，作于楚室。樹之榛栗…”的注脚：屈万里释“定”为营室星，“方中”为初昏在天中；“作于”之“于”当读为“为”，并释“揆”为度日影以定四方。又释“椅、桐、梓、漆”皆可作琴瑟，“虛”…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","poem":{"id":"050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong","title":"定之方中","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","定之方中"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"定之方中","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"作于楚宮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"揆之以日","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"作于楚室","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"樹之榛栗","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"椅桐梓漆","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"爰伐琴瑟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"升彼虛矣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"以望楚矣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"望楚與堂","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"景山與京","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"降觀于桑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"卜云其吉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"終然允臧","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"靈雨既零","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"命彼倌人","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"星言夙駕","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"說于桑田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"匪直也人","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"秉心塞淵","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"騋牝三千","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"quwanli-quanshi","title":"詩經詮釋","authors":["屈萬里"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","era":"现代","publicationYear":1983,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"定之方中，作于楚宮。揆之以日，作于楚室。樹之榛栗。椅桐梓漆，爰伐琴瑟。升彼虛矣，以望楚矣。望楚與堂，景山與京。降觀于桑。卜云其吉，終然允臧。靈雨既零，命彼倌人。星言夙駕，說于桑田。匪直也人，秉心塞淵，騋牝三千！","targetNotes":"《注釋》②至㉖撮要。","sourceLabel":"第 60-61 页","sourceNotes":"书页 60-61《注釋》②至㉖。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"屈万里释“定”为营室星，“方中”为初昏在天中；“作于”之“于”当读为“为”，并释“揆”为度日影以定四方。又释“椅、桐、梓、漆”皆可作琴瑟，“虛”为故城丘墟，“堂”为楚丘旁邑。末章释“靈”为善，“星”当作晴，“說”音税为舍息；并释“秉”为持，“騋牝三千”言马畜众盛。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"定之方中","href":"/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"字词注","title":"定之方中，作于楚宮。揆之以日，作于楚室。樹之榛栗。椅…","href":"/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","isCurrent":true}],"previous":{"title":"定之方中","href":"/shijing/gloss/050-ding-zhi-fang-zhong/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1"},"next":null,"gloss":{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","text":"屈万里释“定”为营室星，“方中”为初昏在天中；“作于”之“于”当读为“为”，并释“揆”为度日影以定四方。又释“椅、桐、梓、漆”皆可作琴瑟，“虛”为故城丘墟，“堂”为楚丘旁邑。末章释“靈”为善，“星”当作晴，“說”音税为舍息；并释“秉”为持，“騋牝三千”言马畜众盛。","notes":null,"id":"0002-1","order":1,"total":1,"annotationId":"0002","parts":[{"id":"part-1","order":1,"excerpt":"屈万里释“定”为营室星，“方中”为初昏在天中；“作于”之“于”当读为“为”，并释“揆”为度日影以定四方。","anchors":[{"key":"1-1","segmentId":"seg-001","surfaceText":"定","charStart":1,"charEnd":1},{"key":"1-2","segmentId":"seg-001","surfaceText":"方中","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"1-3","segmentId":"seg-002","surfaceText":"作于","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"1-4","segmentId":"seg-003","surfaceText":"揆","charStart":1,"charEnd":1}]},{"id":"part-2","order":2,"excerpt":"又释“椅、桐、梓、漆”皆可作琴瑟，“虛”为故城丘墟，“堂”为楚丘旁邑。","anchors":[{"key":"2-1","segmentId":"seg-006","surfaceText":"椅","charStart":1,"charEnd":1},{"key":"2-2","segmentId":"seg-006","surfaceText":"桐","charStart":2,"charEnd":2},{"key":"2-3","segmentId":"seg-006","surfaceText":"梓","charStart":3,"charEnd":3},{"key":"2-4","segmentId":"seg-006","surface